<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Swedish Bank basket.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Swedish Bank basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corporation (Stockholm) has issued five million American-style call warrants, on a Swedish Bank Basket, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>The basket includes one share each of Svenska Handelsbanken, Stadshypotek, Sparbanken Sverige and Skandinaviska Enskilda Banken.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    500 SEK		   ISSUE PRICE  3.56 DEM</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 19.NOV.96-13.MAR.98   PAYDATE	18.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRFT, DUSS		MIN EXER LOT ONE</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  531.80 SEK</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
